{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>לשובע</b> — four times in the Masorah. And the others: ואכלתם לשובע · ואכלתם לחמכם לשובע · צידה שלח להם לשובע. Teaches that even in Egypt, HaKadosh Baruch Hu provided their sustenance, as the Sages, blessed be their memory, expounded: הדגה אשר נאכל במצרים חנם — would it enter your mind that they were given it for free? etc. Rather, HaKadosh Baruch Hu would prepare fish in their jars, and this is צידה שלח להם לשובע."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:09.063983707Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}